{% if can_update %}

### PUT /api/{{ parent }}/bulk

Bulk-update `{{ title }}` records. Each element must include `id` in addition to the
fields accepted by `PUT /api/{{ parent }}/[id]`.

**Request Body** — array of update objects:

```json
[
  { "id": "clxxx...", {{ request_body_json[1:] | indent(2) }},
  { "id": "clyyy...", "..." : "..." }
]
```

**Response `207`** — `data` of each successful item is `{ "success": true }`.
Items with an unknown `id` report `"error": "Not found: <id>"`.
{% endif %}
